                'information about the Hardings, including Nicholas and '
                'Michael’s whereabouts on the night they are shot. Ultimately, '
                'Andrea chooses to forego law school and becomes her father’s '
                'new partner in Harding Industries, no doubt with many '
                'adventures yet to come. Masterfully told using a smattering '
