                'complicated, co-opted, and sometimes defeated attempts to '
                'minstrelize them.So, while Part fact, part fiction, Tyehimba '
                "Jess's much anticipated second book weaves sonnet, song, and "
                'narrative to examine the lives of mostly unrecorded African '
                'American performers directly before and after the Civil War '
